<div class="theorem-conditions stagger">

  <article class="reveal reveal-scale">
    <span>01 · NE</span>

    <h3>
      Effective non-excludability
    </h3>

    <p>
      Access cannot be effectively conditioned on contribution:
      non-contributors continue to receive the relevant benefit
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="reveal reveal-scale">
    <span>02 · NR</span>

    <h3>
      Relevant non-rivalry
    </h3>

    <p>
      Use of the relevant benefit must not meaningfully reduce
      what remains available to others
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="reveal reveal-scale">
    <span>03 · CV</span>

    <h3>
      Persistent collapse of voluntary provision
    </h3>

    <p>
      The incentive to benefit without contributing must undermine
      the financing, coordination, or participation needed to sustain
      the function over time
    </p>
  </article>

</div>
